2️⃣5️⃣ ACK, NAK & Timeout

ACK

Means:

> Successfully received.



NAK/NACK

Means:

> Something was wrong; retransmission may be needed.



Timeout

If ACK doesn't arrive within expected time:

Timeout
   ↓
Retransmit


