🧠 60-Second Revision

Remember this:

Stop-and-Wait
→ 1 frame at a time

Go-Back-N
→ Multiple frames
→ Retransmit lost + following frames
→ Wmax = 2^m - 1

Selective Repeat
→ Multiple frames
→ Buffer out-of-order frames
→ Retransmit only lost frames
→ Wmax = 2^(m-1)

BDP
→ Bandwidth × RTT

🔥 Most important distinction:

> GBN = Go back and retransmit many



> SR = Select and retransmit only the bad one




